# Hand-written: abbreviations the wordlist has only in capitals that are
# often typed in lower case (ok for OK). build-dict.py adds the lowercase
# spelling as a word too, one step less frequent so that suggestions keep
# the capitals: typed in lower case, it stands. Not for abbreviations whose
# lowercase spelling is a likely slip for a common word (amd for and).
OK
SMS
TV
PC
GSM
HIV
UFO
CV
DJ
MKB
BBP
